WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.257
This is a short recording, made to show the player and its transcript.

00:00:04.707 --> 00:00:08.269
Each line of the transcript is a cue, with the time it begins.

00:00:08.719 --> 00:00:12.609
The line being spoken is marked, and the transcript keeps it in view.

00:00:13.059 --> 00:00:17.197
Lines you have heard turn quiet. The ones still to come wait in plain ink.

00:00:17.647 --> 00:00:21.337
Choose any line to jump to it, or scroll away and come back later.

00:00:21.787 --> 00:00:24.641
That is the whole recording. Thank you for listening.
